  "author_html": "<bdi><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Limbourg_brothers\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Limbourg brothers\">Limbourg brothers</a></bdi> / <bdi><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Barth%C3%A9lemy_d%27Eyck\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:Barthélemy d'Eyck\"><span title=\"Early Netherlandish painter and manuscript illuminator (1420-1470)\">Barthélemy d'Eyck</span></a></bdi>",
